From: Can H. Tartanoglu <can@tartanoglu.com>
Date: Sun, 31 May 2026 00:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] server: add trusted local provisioning token

Add `immich-admin provision-token --ttl <seconds>` so local service
operators can mint a short-lived admin session token for declarative
provisioners without storing a long-lived API key. Also make the
admin-create password field optional at validation time; UserAdminService
already rejects passwordless creates unless OAuth is enabled.
